# description: Change Firestore database orders in project acme-prod (pointInTimeRecoveryEnablement)
PATCH /v1/projects/acme-prod/databases/orders HTTP/1.1
Host: firestore.googleapis.com
Authorization: Bearer opf_EXAMPLE_google_access_token
Content-Type: application/json

{"pointInTimeRecoveryEnablement": "POINT_IN_TIME_RECOVERY_DISABLED"}
